 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp | 20 +++++++++--
 iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdreno.cpp      | 49 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

